Cascading Style Sheet
used to describe the style of a document

link HTML and CSS files
<link rel="stylesheet" href="path">

Selector{
  Property:Value;
}

can use multiple selectors
selector1, selector2, selector3{ }

selectors:
* { } (universal selector)
h1 { } (element selector. tag selector basically)
#myId { } (creates a specific id, only applies properties on that element) (programming convention to use one id for one element)
.myClass { } (creates a class, applies properties to all elements with that class)


